/*
 * Declares the MathIntOperatorValue class.
 *
 * MathIntOperatorValue represents binary arithmetic operations applied to two
 * integer operands. These operations implement the standard integer arithmetic
 * semantics of the language, including:
 *
 *   - addition,
 *   - subtraction,
 *   - multiplication,
 *   - division,
 *   - modulo,
 *   - and any other integer-specific arithmetic operator.
 *
 * The result type is an integer type provided at construction. The operator
 * never produces an lvalue, and throwers are inherited from both operands.
 * 
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::binary::int_::math
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/binary/int_/math.yr
